  "_comment": "EVMI autoloader config for the Clear DeFi exporter. Replace every 0x…/<...> placeholder (RPC URL, contract addresses, start blocks, DSNs, plugin gitUrl) before use. Resources are created if absent on startup (idempotent). The ABIs below are the event surface of the current contracts (github.com/…/clear-smart-contracts): reserves + their governance settings, IOUs, the reserve factory, the curve pool deployer, curve pools and both oracle contracts.",
